\eqn{x_t = x_{t-1} + v_t}, \eqn{v_t \sim N(0, \sigma)}, is written
\eqn{x_t = x_0 + \omega \tilde{x}_t} with \eqn{\tilde{x}_t} a standard random walk and
\eqn{\omega = \pm \sqrt{\sigma}}. The prior \eqn{\omega \sim N(0, V_\omega)} that
